            <ArticleTitle>Gene Dosage Experiments in Enterobacteriaceae Using Arabinose-regulated Promoters.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e2396</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.21769/BioProtoc.2396</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This protocol is used to assay the effect of protein over-expression on fitness of E. coli. It is based on a plasmid expression of a protein of interest from an arabinose-regulated pBAD promoter followed by the measurement of the intracellular protein abundance by Western blot along with the measurement of growth parameters of E. coli cell expressing this protein.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
